.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-export 1  "quarters-export " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-export \- Export an authenticated plaintext template or snapshot bundle
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-export\fR [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-confirm\-sensitive\-state\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-to\fR> <\fB\-\-key\fR> <\fIKIND\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export an authenticated plaintext template or snapshot bundle
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Absolute bundle destination outside the Quarters store
.TP
\fB\-\-key\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Absolute private 32\-byte key file in a protected directory outside the Quarters store
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR
Authenticate inputs and report the exact policy without writing
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\-sensitive\-state\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Exactly repeat NAME to acknowledge plaintext sensitive\-state export
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIKIND\fR>
Artifact category
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
template: Reusable creation source
.IP \(bu 2
snapshot: Named recovery point; imports as a template
.RE
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Existing artifact display name
